:: DailyHub [hub]
<<nobr>>
<<if $day is 1>>
<<startDay 9 3>>

<<if $gameMinutes >= 1380>>
<<centerImage "image/events/bedroom.png">>
<h2>Day 1</h2>
<<if $currentMapLocation isnot "home">>
<p>I'm exhausted. Somehow I make it home, legs heavy, barely keeping my eyes open.</p>
<<set $currentMapLocation to "home">>
<</if>>
<p><strong>I'm exhausted.</strong> My eyes keep drifting shut mid-thought. Whatever else I meant to do today, it'll have to wait. There's only one thing left to do.</p>
<<link `"Go to sleep - end Day " + $day`>><<goto "Day1_Night">><</link>>

<<else>>

<<if $gameMinutes is 420>>
<p>My alarm doesn't wake me. The sun does, cutting through the gap in my curtains like a blade. I roll over, grab my phone, squint at the screen. 9:47 AM. Saturday. A text from Chloe sits at the top of my notifications: <em>"Come over later? Miss you xo."</em> I type back a thumbs up emoji and toss the phone onto my pillow.</p>
<p>The day's mine to spend however I want - but there's only so much of it. Whatever I do costs time, and eventually I'll be too tired to keep going.</p>
<</if>>

<<if $currentMapLocation is "home">>
<<centerImage "image/location/home.png">>
<h2>Home</h2>
<p>I'm home. The house is quiet except for whatever Evelyn or Lily are up to.</p>
<<elseif $currentMapLocation is "neighborhood">>
<<centerImage "image/events/street.png">>
<h2>Neighborhood</h2>
<p>Out on the street. The block looks the same as always.</p>
<<elseif $currentMapLocation is "chloe">>
<<centerImage "image/events/chloe_home.png">>
<h2>Chloe's Apartment</h2>
<p>Outside Chloe's building, third floor buzzer sticky as ever.</p>
<</if>>

<<lateWarning>>

<<locationTasks $currentMapLocation>>

<div class="travel-links">
<<if $currentMapLocation is "home">>
<<link "Walk to the Neighborhood">><<set $currentMapLocation to "neighborhood">><<goto "DailyHub">><</link>><br>
<<link "Take the bus to Chloe's Apartment">><<set $currentMapLocation to "chloe">><<goto "DailyHub">><</link>>
<p class="sleep-early"><<link "Head to bed early" "Day1_Night">><</link>></p>
<<elseif $currentMapLocation is "neighborhood">>
<<link "Head back home">><<set $currentMapLocation to "home">><<goto "DailyHub">><</link>>
<<elseif $currentMapLocation is "chloe">>
<<link "Head back home">><<set $currentMapLocation to "home">><<goto "DailyHub">><</link>>
<</if>>
</div>

<</if>>

<<else>>
<<centerImage "image/events/bedroom.png">>
<h2>Day <<print $day>></h2>
<p>The sun comes up the same as it always does. But this is as far as Alex's story has been written so far - Day <<print $day>> hasn't been authored yet.</p>
<p>Thanks for playing through Day 1 of <strong>Pretty Little Secrets</strong>. Check back soon for more of Alex's story.</p>
<div class="version-note">
  <p class="version-badge">Version 0.0.1 complete!</p>
  <p>If you enjoyed this and want to support future updates, consider visiting my <a href="https://www.patreon.com/c/zaramystique" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Patreon</a> &#10084;&#65039;</p>
</div>
<</if>>
<</nobr>>
